   "source": [
    "## Data Preparation\n",
    "\n",
    "Our data preparation consists of **four parts**:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Cleaning\n",
    "- Cropping\n",
    "- Augmentation\n",
    "- Splitting"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2cfd5322-1a2c-499d-87ea-2f897b4fcf46",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Data Cleaning"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d0d1691b-c2fd-452b-afe9-19acb9a10aa7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### Removing Insects with NA rank\n",
    "\n",
    "We remove all the insect with NA rank because they are unnecessary for training our model.\n",
    "\n",
    "- First we **get the background** color from the surrounding of the selected insect.\n",
    "- Then **paint over** the insect.\n",
    "- Lastly we **remove the label** from the labels text file."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "bcdac24f-365a-40b1-af24-166f181e8527",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def yolo_to_pixels(xc, yc, w, h, img_w, img_h):\n",
    "    # Step 1: Convert YOLO normalized box to pixel coordinates (x1,y1,x2,y2)\n",
    "    cx = xc * img_w\n",
    "    cy = yc * img_h\n",
    "    bw = w * img_w\n",
    "    bh = h * img_h\n",
    "    x1 = cx - bw / 2.0\n",
    "    y1 = cy - bh / 2.0\n",
    "    x2 = cx + bw / 2.0\n",
    "    y2 = cy + bh / 2.0\n",
    "    return x1, y1, x2, y2\n",
    "\n",
    "def pixels_to_yolo(x1, y1, x2, y2, crop_w, crop_h):\n",
    "    # Step 5: Convert pixel box inside crop to YOLO normalized relative to crop size\n",
    "    bw = x2 - x1\n",
    "    bh = y2 - y1\n",
    "    cx = x1 + bw / 2.0\n",
    "    cy = y1 + bh / 2.0\n",
    "    return (cx / crop_w, cy / crop_h, bw / crop_w, bh / crop_h)\n",
    "\n",
    "def clamp(val, low, high):\n",
    "    return max(low, min(val, high))\n",
    "\n",
    "def box_area(x1, y1, x2, y2):\n",
    "    return max(0, x2 - x1) * max(0, y2 - y1)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "0cce754e-bb3f-4edb-b720-57eeac07775e",
