    "#### Removing Unwanted Classes\n",
    "\n",
    "Removing classes with very few images."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "ae5e1ce3-c04b-4579-8c98-2a6af214e0ea",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
