   "source": [
    "#### How to tune parameters\n",
    "\n",
    "- ```distance_mode=\"relative\" with DISTANCE_THRESHOLD_REL=0.05``` means cluster centers within ~5% of the image diagonal are grouped. Increase if insects are more spread out; decrease if they’re dense.\n",
    "- ```MARGIN=0.15``` adds 15% padding around the cluster bounding box — prevents cutting legs or antennae. Increase to be safer.\n",
    "- ```MIN_VISIBLE_FRACTION=0.25``` will discard boxes that are mostly outside the crop — set smaller if we want to keep more partial boxes.\n",
    "- ```SAVE_SINGLETONS=True``` controls whether single-insect clusters produce crops (for debugging)."
   ]
  },
